  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1506.01 Conditions of Payment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1506.01 Conditions of Payment.\n\n(a) The department shall approve a rebate application submitted as specified in Env-Dw 1505 if it determines:\n\n(1) A rebate has not been issued for the eligible costs through a previous rebate;\n\n(2) Sufficient funds remain in the program account to execute the rebate; and\n\n(3) Submission of the rebate application in accordance with Env-Dw 1505.01(a) is within 12 months of the completion of the remedy for which the rebate is sought.\n\n(b) Upon approval of a rebate application, the department shall authorize a rebate to be distributed for eligible costs, subject to the availability of program funds and to the limitations in Env-Dw 1506.02.\n\nSource. #14201, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1500.html"
